# Mac Studio API restart

Restarting the live Express API is the agent's job when this Cursor instance is on Yan's Mac Studio and the change set affects that process. Do not skip it or leave it for the user. Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).

## Gate (must pass)

Confirm Mac Studio before any restart:

```bash
hostname | grep -qi 'Mac-Studio' || scutil --get ComputerName | grep -qi 'Mac Studio'
```

Skip restart on MacBook, Cursor Cloud, or any other host.

## Applicable changes

Restart when edits affect the running Node process, e.g. `server/**`, `server/package.json`, or `deploy/launchagents/com.epsynapse.server.plist` / root `npm run server` plumbing.

Skip for static HTML/CSS/JS, iOS, Vercel-only, or docs-only.

## Restart command

```bash
launchctl kickstart -k "gui/$(id -u)/com.epsynapse.server"
curl -sS -f http://127.0.0.1:3006/health
```

That LaunchAgent is the production equivalent of `npm run server`. If it is not loaded and a manual `npm run server` is running, stop it and start `npm run server` from the repo root instead, then verify `/health`.
